category: Libs
build-depends: cygport 
sdesc: "Compact general purpose allocator with excellent performance (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "mimalloc (pronounced 'me-malloc') is a general purpose allocator with
excellent performance characteristics. Initially developed by Daan Leijen for
the run-time systems of the Koka and Lean languages."
